itude). This practice is now obsolete and at present length is a quantity, its numerical value its magnitude.", "reference": "1999, Arnošt Kotyk, “Introduction”, in Quantities, Symbols, Units, and Abbreviations in the Life Sciences: A Guide for Authors and Editors, Humana Press, →ISBN:"}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [{"language": {"code": "sq", "name": "Albanian"}, "word": "sasi"}, {"language": {"code": "ar", "name": "Arabic"}, "word": "كَمِّيَّة"}, {"language": {"code": "ar", "name": "Arabic"}, "word": "مِقْدَار"}, {"language": {"code": "ar", "name": "Arabic"}, "word": "قدر"}, {"language": {"code": "hy", "name": "Armenian"}, "word": "քանակ"}, {"language": {"code": "ast", "name": "Asturian"}, "word": "cantidá"}, {"language": {"code": "av", "name": "Avar"}, "word": "къадар"}, {"language": {"code": "az", "name": "Azerbaijani"}, "word": "kəmiyyət"}, {"language": {"code": "az", "name": "Azerbaijani"}, "word": "miqdar"}, {"language": {"code": "ba", "name": "Bashkir"}, "word": "һан"}, {"language": {"code": "ba", "name": "Bashkir"}, "word": "миҡдар"}, {"language": {"code": "eu", "name": "Basque"}, "word": "kantitatea"}, {"language": {"code": "be", "name": "Belarusian"}, "word": "ко́лькасць"}, {"language": {"code": "be", "name": "Belarusian"}, "word": "ко́лькасьць"}, {"language": {"code": "bn", "name": "Bengali"}, "word": "পরিমাণ"}, {"language": {"code": "bg", "name": "Bulgarian"}, "word": "коли́чество"}, {"language": {"code": "my", "name": "Burmese"}, "word": "အရေအတွက်"}, {"language": {"code": "ca", "name": "Catalan"}, "word": "quantitat"}, {"language": {"code": "nan-hbl", "name": "Chinese"}, "word": "數量 /数量"}, {"language": {"code": "cmn", "name": "Chinese Mandarin"}, "word": "數量 /数量"}, {"language": {"code": "cmn", "name": "Chinese Mandarin"}, "word": "量"}, {"language": {"code": "cmn", "name": "Chinese Mandarin"}, "word": "數字 /数字"}, {"language": {"code": "cmn", "name": "Chinese Mandarin"}, "word": "數目 /数目"}, {"language": {"code": "cmn", "name": "Chines